Value user (\S+)
Value pid (\d+)
Value cpu_percent ([\d.]+)
Value mem_percent ([\d.]+)
Value vsz (\d+)
Value rss (\d+)
Value tty (\S+)
Value stat (\S+)
Value start (\S+)
Value time (\S+)
Value command (.+)

Start
  ^USER\s+PID\s+%CPU\s+%MEM\s+VSZ\s+RSS\s+TTY\s+STAT\s+START\s+TIME\s+COMMAND\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${user}\s+${pid}\s+${cpu_percent}\s+${mem_percent}\s+${vsz}\s+${rss}\s+${tty}\s+${stat}\s+${start}\s+${time}\s+${command}$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
